-# Mockup: 30-rk.js `mFull` (:61-62), which confirms only the switch TO the full
-# ranking. Both directions are confirmed here: widening the board exposes the
-# bottom of the list, and narrowing it takes places away from people who could
-# see them a moment ago. Either way a student's view changes without them
-# touching anything, which is what is worth a sentence.
- full = mode == 'full'

- if full
  %h2#gh-rk-title.gh-h2 Pokazać pełny ranking?
  %p
    Każdy student zobaczy miejsca i pseudonimy wszystkich, także osób na końcu
    listy.
- else
  %h2#gh-rk-title.gh-h2 Ograniczyć ranking do podium?
  %p
    Studentom zostaną pierwsze 3 miejsca i ich własne. Nikt nie zobaczy, kto
    jest na końcu listy.

.gh-dlg-b
  -# The safe button is the one that keeps the current setting, and it is the
  -# one you land on.
  - if @in_modal
    %button.gh-btn.gh-btn--sec{ type: 'button', data: { action: 'dialog#close' }, autofocus: true }
      = full ? 'Zostaw podium' : 'Anuluj'
  - else
    = link_to (full ? 'Zostaw podium' : 'Anuluj'), story_group_ranking_path(story_group),
      class: 'gh-btn gh-btn--sec'

  = button_to (full ? 'Pokaż pełny ranking' : 'Pokaż tylko podium'),
    story_group_ranking_path(story_group),
    method: :patch, class: 'gh-btn',
    params: { story_group: { ranking_mode: mode } },
    form: { data: { turbo_frame: (@in_modal ? 'modal' : nil) } }
